": "Fix usage bar detection (#5)", "created_at": "2026-01-09T19:44:55Z", "repo": "tracklaude", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "abac90c7bf42310d3a0af72370d1b69707abe96f", "message": "docs: readme (#4)", "created_at": "2026-01-06T14:02:19Z", "repo": "tracklaude", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d9bdcd0b5eaaa9d61c80c52d1c9c0926f2fe4d1d", "message": "Add clock icon to extension (#3)\n\n* feat: add extension icon\n\n* Add clock icon to extension\n\n- Created coral-colored clock icon matching Claude's design aesthetic\n- Added icon assets in 16x, 48x, and 128x sizes\n- Configured action icon to display colored icon when extension is pinned\n- Icon displays proper colors in toolbar instead of grayscale", "created_at": "2026-01-06T12:52:46Z", "repo": "tracklaude", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0bb0446d7ad8a80d95f7e3897e74e8e1dfd81c12", "message": "Merge pull request #2 from Portavion/Portavion/live-progress-update\n\nUpdate progress bars when usage data refreshes", "created_at": "2026-01-06T12:39:37Z", "repo": "tracklaude", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "597dda685712e121a769ecb64fcb599b105c1bcf", "message": "feat: update progress bars when usage data refreshes\n\nDetect and respond to usage data changes from page refresh or automatic updates. Tracks reset time values to identify when data actually changes, then re-injects updated progress bars with new calculations.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-06T12:38:50Z", "repo": "tracklaude", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "297deb6a3235d16558bb2bf545c5f79c40348493", "message": "Merge pull request #1 from Portavion/Portavion/claude-usage-bar\n\nAdd Claude usage time progression bars", "created_at": "2026-01-06T12:24:59Z", "repo": "tracklaude", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b27df40bb0a7ce56fb6b0105f5e1dbab75ed98d0", "message": "Add support for Sonnet-only usage bar\n\nExtends the time progression bar injection to include the Sonnet-only usage limit, displaying how much time has elapsed in the weekly reset window alongside the existing Current session and All models bars.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-01-06T12:23:54Z", "repo": "tracklaude", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ec0ae9ee87cb0705d61b277bb8feb0cdad44d6a1", "message": "feat: add progress bar to anthropic usage page", "created_at": "2026-01-06T12:14:45Z", "repo": "tracklaude", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b7962046e5e6289787f243c2a8ca70883f806e34", "message": "first commit", "created_at": "2026-01-06T11:59:54Z", "repo": "tracklaude", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "05be02f996b90ecfd86bc9d6d772d709fa9ea7c2", "message": "chore: remove draft posts", "created_at": "2026-01-12T22:48:27Z", "repo": "blog", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bf9cc35cbbf7f60d0c8c8d84e5eac5c358551dda", "message": "feat: update about and homepage", "created_at": "2026-01-11T16:15:02Z", "repo": "blog", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b9baf6cf50f2fd9961d366ea5916b73d9ffc8c89", "message": "feat: basic config", "created_at": "2026-01-11T15:21:44Z", "repo": "blog", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7685d80e2e7a8f03b40dc964d3a13e52b1294c05", "message": "fix: nojekyll", "created_at": "2026-01-10T17:32:16Z", "repo": "blog", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha":